{"unit_id":"SuperLS-X__dsh-minecraft-theme#card-zh","repo":"SuperLS-X/dsh-minecraft-theme","commit":"496d2377791368b0aebce6a6f06471e49b9f7597","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-minecraft-theme 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Minecraft 像素风主题插件。它通过主题 token、侧边栏操作和覆盖层组件接入界面，提供方块背景与气泡纹理切换、纹理导入和管理、像素字体、按钮点击音效及音乐播放器。纹理面板可调整大小并管理内置和自定义纹理；音乐面板支持播放控制和本地音乐文件夹。适合希望把 DSH 界面改成 Minecraft 风格并播放背景音乐的用户。在线兜底资源从 jsDelivr 加载，设置保存到工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:911-929","lib/index.js:323-345"]}
{"unit_id":"SuperLS-X__dsh-minecraft-theme#card-en","repo":"SuperLS-X/dsh-minecraft-theme","commit":"496d2377791368b0aebce6a6f06471e49b9f7597","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-minecraft-theme gives the DSH web client a Minecraft pixel look. Sidebar panels let users choose and resize block textures for the background or chat bubbles, import and manage custom textures, and play Minecraft music or local tracks. It also applies pixel fonts and button sounds.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:911-929","lib/index.js:323-345"]}
